  <description>BQ-410 VSLAM variant with a downward-facing monocular camera for ArUco marker precision landing. Same sensor suite as bq410_vslam (D455 depth stereo camera for VIO/VSLAM, optical flow, LW20 rangefinder, OdometryPublisher for ground-truth external vision), plus a downward mono camera for detecting an ArUco landing pad. Use with the aruco world. Tuning from BQ-410-RS.params via airframe 4026_gz_bq410_vslam_precland.</description>
</model>
